Vendored content: libbpf + libxdp (headers under vendor/include, .so under
vendor/lib) so the binary does not depend on distro paths for those.

PostgreSQL client (libpq), OpenSSL, etc. stay on the system (pg_config for
compile, system -lssl -lcrypto -lpq at link time).

  make
  make vendor        # re-stage bpf/xdp only
  make vendor-clean && make

No DB headers or libpq copies in vendor/.

Skip vendoring (system libbpf/libxdp only):

  make vendor-clean
  SKIP_VENDOR=1 make build

patchelf recommended for vendored .so self-resolution (apt install patchelf).
